Subject: [PATCH 128/194] power: supply: qcom_qg: import the IIO_CONSUMER
 namespace

Since 7.3 the IIO consumer API is exported in the IIO_CONSUMER namespace.
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_qg.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_qg.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_qg.c
index 0bd75196d..1637c806c 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_qg.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_qg.c
@@ -299,3 +299,4 @@ module_platform_driver(qcom_qg_driver);
 MODULE_AUTHOR("Danila Tikhonov <danila@jiaxyga.com>");
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("Qualcomm PMIC QGauge (QG) driver");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL");
+MODULE_IMPORT_NS("IIO_CONSUMER");
